+## Release Recommendation
+
+**Do not release.** The HIGH finding must be fixed before merging. The implemented patch (`factory-validate.sh --quick` checks) is structurally correct but placed in the wrong code path. A minimal fix — hoisting the schema and plan checks above the `--quick` early exit — will satisfy the original implementation intent and make the finding go away. Full-mode validation must verify these artifacts for the factory's "measurable" property to hold.
+
+After fixing, re-run `factory-validate.sh` (full mode) and confirm it fails on a workspace missing `plan.md` or an eval schema, then passes with all artifacts present.
